            "id": "s_l4_1",
            "type": "text",
            "title": "What Are Scoped Slots?",
            "content": "# Scoped Slots: Giving Data Back\n\nSometimes a component needs to provide data to the slot content – for example, a list component that exposes each item to a custom template.\n\n**Scoped slots** allow the child component to pass data to the slot, which the parent can access.\n\n```html\n<!-- Child template -->\n<slot :item=\"item\" :index=\"index\"></slot>\n\n<!-- Parent usage -->\n<template #default=\"{ item, index }\">\n  <div>{{ index }}: {{ item.name }}</div>\n</template>\n```\n\nThe slot props are available in the parent's slot scope."
        },
        {
            "id": "s_l4_2",
            "type": "text",
            "title": "Practical Example: Data Table",
            "content": "# Building a Reusable Data Table\n\nA table component that accepts an array of items and a column configuration, using scoped slots to let the parent customize each cell.\n\n```html\n<DataTable :items=\"users\">\n  <template #cell-name=\"{ item }\">\n    <strong>{{ item.name }}</strong>\n  </template>\n  <template #cell-actions=\"{ item }\">\n    <button @click=\"edit(item)\">Edit</button>\n  </template>\n</DataTable>\n```\n\nThis keeps the table logic generic while allowing full customizability."
        },
        {
            "id": "s_l4_3",
            "type": "code",
            "title": "Example: Scoped Slot for List",
            "content": "A reusable list component that uses scoped slots:",
            "codeSnippet": "<div id=\"app\">\n  <reusable-list :items=\"fruits\">\n    <template #default=\"{ item, index }\">\n      <div style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\">\n        <strong>{{ index + 1 }}.</strong> {{ item.name }}\n        <button @click=\"removeItem(index)\">✖</button>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </reusable-list>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const ReusableList = {\n    props: ['items'],\n    template: `\n      <div class=\"list\">\n        <div v-for=\"(item, idx) in items\" :key=\"idx\">\n          <slot :item=\"item\" :index=\"idx\"></slot>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `\n  };\n\n  createApp({\n    components: { ReusableList },\n    data() {\n      return {\n        fruits: [\n          { name: 'Apple' },\n          { name: 'Banana' },\n          { name: 'Orange' }\n        ]\n      };\n    },\n    methods: {\n      removeItem(index) {\n        this.fruits.splice(index, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }).mount('#app');\n</script>",
            "codeLanguage": "html",
            "canRunCode": true
        },
